yaml-cpp 0.8.0 uses uint16_t/uint32_t in emitterutils.cpp without including
<cstdint>, which GCC 13+ no longer provides transitively. Fixed upstream
after the 0.8.0 release; this patch backports the include to the pinned tag.
--- a/src/emitterutils.cpp
+++ b/src/emitterutils.cpp
@@ -1,4 +1,5 @@
 #include <algorithm>
+#include <cstdint>
 #include <iomanip>
 #include <sstream>

